<div class=chatlog__message-group><div id=chatlog__message-container-1468708367756165206 class=chatlog__message-container data-message-id=1468708367756165206><div class=chatlog__message><div class=chatlog__message-aside><img class=chatlog__avatar src=https://cdn.discordapp.com/embed/avatars/4.png alt=Avatar loading=lazy></div><div class=chatlog__message-primary><div class=chatlog__header><span class=chatlog__author title=dadventuressteve data-user-id=1264035953933156432>Veilocity</span> <span class=chatlog__timestamp title="Wednesday, February 4, 2026 3:42 PM"><a href=#chatlog__message-container-1468708367756165206>2/4/2026 3:42 PM</a></span></div><div class="chatlog__content chatlog__markdown"><span class=chatlog__markdown-preserve><strong>რეზონანსიდან კონტროლამდე <img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="⚠️"
    title="warning"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/26a0.svg"><img
